Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.52,0:00:03.65,Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wealth, fame, power...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:07.82,Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2}Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,\Nobtained everything the world has to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.82,0:00:11.66,Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What he said in his final moments\Ndrove countless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.66,0:00:13.66,Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.66,0:00:15.45,Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.45,0:00:16.66,Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,Find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.66,0:00:19.25,Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,Everything is right where I left it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:26.38,Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2}People set their sights on the Grand Line\Nin pursuit of their dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:29.63,Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The world has truly entered\Nthe Great Pirate Era!
